<title>NETHERLANDS: Kenya Airways becomes passenger GSA for KLM in Sudan.</title>
<headline>Kenya Airways becomes passenger GSA for KLM in Sudan.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya Airways has been appointed the general sales agent for KLM Royal Dutch Airlines in Sudan, a KLM spokesman said.</p>
<p>The deal only covers the passenger side and KLM sales staff in the region have been transferred to Kenya Airways and are now employed by the African carrier, he added.</p>
<p>KLM holds a 26 percent stake in Kenya Airways.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
